Ten seconds: the buckle ignition (0.00-4.00) cut straight into the thread
passage (4.00-10.00). Cue 5 sits exactly on the join, which is a hard cut and
not a dissolve — the thread is the one element continuous across it.

Nothing described here is a garment. The passage is abstract fibre only: no
seam, no pocket, no hardware exists in the scene.

